  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondela henohu mwanta wawanyana kaAmoni hakufwa, mwanindi Hanuni hakumuswana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi nindi, Nimwili mwana kaNahashi Hanuni luwi, neyi chaŋililiyi tata yindi luwi nawa. Davidi hakumutemeshela ambuŋindi nindi akamukundeji nansaŋu yatata yindi. AmbuŋaDavidi hiyakushika mwituŋa dawanyana kaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa atulamba twawanyana kaAmoni hiyakumwila mwanta wawu Hanuni, nawu, Ichi chanakutemesheliyi antu akukukundeja, wunatoŋojoki neyi Davidi wudi nakulemesha tata yeyi tahindi? Komana Davidi hanakutemesheli ambuŋindi kulonda ashinshiki mukala, awendeshi, kulonda wimiki mushi nduku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Hanuni hakukwata ambuŋaDavidi, hakuyitewula wevu wawu chibalu chimu, hakuyiketola mahinawu hakachi, ndo nikuma handa, hakuyila nindi, Yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chamulejeluwu Davidi, hakutemeshelaku antu akuyikinkilila, muloŋa amayala atiyili nsonyi nankashi. Mwanta hakuyila nindi, Shakamenu kuYeriku nichakamena cheŋi wevu wenu, mwakafunti cheni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAmoni chamwenuwu ananunki dehi ivumba datama kudi Davidi, anyana kaAmoni hiyakutemesha antu akukamba aSiriya akuBetire hobi, niaSiriya akuZoba, akwakwenda hamaseki makombakaji makumi ayedi, nimwanta wakuMayaka hamu nawantu ikombakaji, niantu akuTobi makombakaji ikumi nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chachitiyiliyi Davidi hakutemeshaku Yowabi hamu nanjita yejima yawayilobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAmoni hiyakwidika nakutanjika njita kuwiŋililu wakuchisu chamukala. ASiriya akuZoba, niakuRehobi, niantu akuTobi niakuMayaka, niwena adiŋi hakanka wawu mumpata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabi chamweniyi anamutanjikili dehi njita nikumbidi nikunyima, hakutonda antu hadi aIsarela ejima atondewa, hakuyitanjika atalaŋani nawaSiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu asheluku hakuyinka mana kwindi Abishayi, hakuyitanjika kulonda atalaŋani nawanyana kaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Neyi aSiriya ananswejeli Ŋovu, wakankwashaku; neyi anyana kaAmoni anaku swejeli Ŋovu ami nawa nakakukwashaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dikwatishi, tudinkenu jawu yala hanyijimba yawantu etu tulwilenu nyikala yaNzambi yetu; Yehova eli mwanamoniyi kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yowabi nawantu ejima adiŋiyi nawu hiyakuswila kwakwihi nakulwa nawaSiriya; amutemukili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAmoni chamwenuwu aSiriya anatemuki dehi, niwena nawa hiyakumutemuka Abishayi, hiyakwijila mumukala. Yowabi hakufuma kudi anyana kaAmoni, hakufunta, hakwinza kuYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ASiriya chamwenuwu anayitapi dehi kudi aIsarela, hiyakudipompesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadarezeri hakutemesha antu akuleta aSiriya adiŋi kwishinadi daKaloŋa. Hiyakwinza kuHelami, Shobaki mukulumpi wanjita yaHadarezeri natwaminuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumulejamu Davidi. Hakupompesha aIsarela ejima, hakuzambuka Yodana, hakushika kuHelami. ASiriya hiyakuditanjika nawu alwi naDavidi, hiyakulwa nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ASiriya hiyakutemuka aIsarela. Davidi hakujaha aSiriya akwamakálu makulakaji atanu nayedi, niakwakwenda hatuwalu makombakaji makumi awana, hakutapa Shobaki mukulumpi wanjita yawu, hakufwila kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanta ejima adiŋi ambuŋaHadarezeri chamwenuwu anayitapi dehi kudi aIsarela, hiyakutiyaŋana nawaIsarela, hiyakuyikalakela. Dichi aSiriya atiya niwoma wakukwasha cheŋi anyana kaAmoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
